EXEC sp_addextendedproperty @name=N'MS_Description', @value=N'Sequential (each promotion applies to the running total: ten percent then ten percent is nineteen) or Additive (percentages sum: twenty). Per company rather than per promotion, because the mode describes how a SET combines and two promotions disagreeing has no coherent answer. Sequential is the default because it discounts less, so a misconfiguration costs nothing.', @level0type=N'SCHEMA', @level0name=N'__mj_BizAppsOrders', @level1type=N'TABLE', @level1name=N'OrderCompanyPolicy', @level2type=N'COLUMN', @level2name=N'StackingMode';
